01:15:12.620 --> 01:15:19.420
to sit next to you. Okay, truck. So one day there's an announcement, you know, Kiriyaku report to the

01:15:19.420 --> 01:15:24.540
lieutenant's office. You never want to hear your name and the order to report to the lieutenant's

01:15:24.540 --> 01:15:29.020
office because for most people, that means you're going to go to solitary. They got you

01:15:29.020 --> 01:15:33.020
doing something. You're going to solitary. For me, it was that NPR called and they wanted an

01:15:33.020 --> 01:15:37.100
interview. Oh, okay. That's worse. It's slightly more boring than solitary.

01:15:37.260 --> 01:15:45.020
Isn't that interesting? So I had to sign a waiver to allow NPR to come to the prison to interview me.

01:15:45.660 --> 01:15:52.060
So I go back up to the TV room and I'm sitting there next to truck and I'm three feet away from

01:15:52.060 --> 01:15:59.020
cat in the hat, but his back is to me. He's at the computers doing email. He doesn't know that

01:15:59.020 --> 01:16:05.340
I'm three feet away from him. And he turns to the guy next to him and he said, did you

01:16:05.340 --> 01:16:11.900
hear they called Kiriyaku to the lieutenant's office? He goes, that guy's a fucking rat. He went

01:16:11.900 --> 01:16:18.060
down there to rat us out. Well, you call somebody a rat blood's going to be spilled.

01:16:18.860 --> 01:16:23.900
But I didn't I didn't react at all. I just sat there and truck says, did you hear that

01:16:23.900 --> 01:16:29.820
fucker just called you a rat? And I said, yeah, a couple of hours ago, I heard him call you

01:16:29.820 --> 01:16:42.460
a pedophile, which I completely made up. He stood up juicy gossip. He stood up and he beat this

01:16:42.460 --> 01:16:49.260
guy to within an inch of his life. People scattered like cockroaches, which is what you do when

01:16:49.260 --> 01:16:53.500
there's a fight so you don't get right called to the lieutenant's office. I just sat there

01:16:53.500 --> 01:16:59.580
and watched the Steelers game. Right? This is three feet away from me. He beat him into a coma.

01:17:00.380 --> 01:17:06.780
Geez. So I get called down to the lieutenant's office. And the lieutenant says, why don't you

01:17:06.780 --> 01:17:14.860
tell me about that fight? I said, there was a fight. Admit nothing, deny everything,

01:17:14.860 --> 01:17:18.380
make counter accusations. He says, you know, damn well, there was a fight.

01:17:19.020 --> 01:17:22.780
I said, I don't know anything about a fight. I've been watching the Steelers all day.

01:17:24.460 --> 01:17:30.620
And he says, we saw you on camera sitting there while the fight was taking place

01:17:30.620 --> 01:17:35.900
three feet away from you. And I said, yeah, maybe that was you that was sitting there

01:17:35.900 --> 01:17:40.140
watching the fight. I was watching the Steelers. Do you ever think of that?

01:17:40.140 --> 01:17:46.540
Where were you when the fight was going on? Mm hmm. Make counter accusations. Right.

01:17:46.540 --> 01:17:51.580
And he says, get the fuck out of my office. That's right. So that's how you serve.

01:17:51.580 --> 01:17:56.140
So and that is the technique you use to survive. Cat in the Hat was a problem.

01:17:56.940 --> 01:18:02.620
So truck was a problem. Truck was sent. Truck got another five years for the assault

01:18:03.660 --> 01:18:08.780
and was upgraded to a medium security prison, which is which is tough time.

01:18:09.660 --> 01:18:16.810
Right. Cat in the Hat was in the hospital for several weeks. And then he was in solitary

01:18:16.810 --> 01:18:22.730
for a month. And and he came back and everybody, everybody told him what had happened.

01:18:23.850 --> 01:18:30.890
So he walks up to me like this and he goes, I just wanted to apologize that I called you a rat.

01:18:30.890 --> 01:18:35.930
I shouldn't have done it. And I'll never do it again. And I said, listen to me,

01:18:35.930 --> 01:18:43.770
because I'm going to just say this once, if I ever hear my name cross your lips ever again,

01:18:44.730 --> 01:18:54.570
you're dead. Do you understand? He goes, yes, I understand. Nobody fucked with me ever.

01:18:55.290 --> 01:19:04.330
Right. I mean, it's a powerful, it's a powerful realization to know that when you're in prison,

01:19:04.890 --> 01:19:09.450
you have to do what you have to do. You have to survive. And the fact that the CIA and those

01:19:09.450 --> 01:19:14.890
techniques you were able to utilize, I suppose, again, speaking of irony on top of irony,

01:19:14.890 --> 01:19:18.810
it's because of the people in charge of the CIA specifically Schmuck,

